  "solution": {
    "text": "For <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></math> collision should be completely inelastic.<br /><br />According to energy conservation principle,<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> ...(i))<br /><br />According to momentum conservation principle.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(ii)<br /><br />After solving eq. (i) an d(ii), we get<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math><br /><br />Here, <math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo></math> minimum excitation energy<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>10.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mtext>6.25</mtext><mo>&#xD7;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#xA0;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#xA0;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
